      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00593",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "[\\[28\\]](#part1334.html#w28) 风俗歌《常陆》云：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The folk song Hitachi says:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00593",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "“我在常陆勤耕田，胸无杂念心自专。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In Hitachi I work hard tilling the fields, with no stray thoughts in my heart and my mind wholly devoted.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00593",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "你却疑我有外遇，超山过岭雨夜来。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yet you suspect me of having another love, and come on a rainy night over mountains and ridges.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
